{"id": "EUVD-2026-104682", "enisaUuid": "6d2f26b2-7088-39c0-ab2c-d4d786865a9a", "description": "piflow 2.0.0 through 2.0.1 contains a remote code execution vulnerability in its DeepAgents chat agent, whose POST /chat and POST /chat/stream endpoints lack authentication. Attackers can instruct the agent to call the exec_shell tool, which runs arbitrary commands via subprocess.run without human approval or an allow-list, exposing environment secrets such as LLM API keys and database credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T00:46:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T16:07:55", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.lasso.security/vulnerability-database/cve-2026-109442", "https://github.com/cas-bigdatalab/piflow/blob/ad8d0108a54a4257307d4946dc9250e26f24c63f/agents/tools.py#L114", "https://github.com/cas-bigdatalab/piflow/blob/ad8d0108a54a4257307d4946dc9250e26f24c63f/server.py#L615", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/piflow-2.0.0-through-2.0.1-unauthenticated-rce-via-chat-agent-exec-shell"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9925-27m4-6rvp", "CVE-2026-109442"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.69, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8e1c51de-4979-30c7-a60d-b26f03b9f80f", "product": {"name": "piflow", "vendor": {"name": "cas-bigdatalab"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 \u22642.0.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "716235f0-e1e9-3ad6-9693-19b94b857bdd", "vendor": {"name": "cas-bigdatalab"}}], "isExploited": false}